Z||000000||Uaana||03-24-2000||04:00 AM||||I'm almost done with the mechanical things<BR>that she needs, and am getting ready to fix <BR>the body.. Now a couple of questions<BR>1 I'm looking for a link for the guy who makes the euro taillights for the GT I just <BR>saw it here about a week ago and now I can't<BR>find it. 2. does anyone know if he makes a<BR>set that retains the illuminated pontiac in<BR>the middle?  3. has anyone tried to install<BR>a led 3rd brakelight in the wing?<P>thanx all||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||03-24-2000||01:48 PM||||I have a 26" LED in my stock wing. I fiberglased in 4 plastic mounts (after cutting a notch in the bottom of the wing.. i've had to replace it twice.. (free replacement) the chip in thier little e-prom thing rattles out and it won't light up any more... I disconnected the factory light. Oh everyone is gunna ask you if your light is on a different switch.. the LED turns on in like 3/100ths of a second the regular lights take like a 1/10th.. noticable delay... looks pretty sharp though! ||||reg||1
